   "text": "The stem-and-leaf diagram below shows the distribution of the ages of the passengers in a bus.\n:::stemleaf\nStem (tens) | Leaf (units)\n1 | h 4 6\n2 | 3 3 3 4 6 7 7\n3 | 1 2 2 2 6 8\n4 | 0 k\n:::\nIf the range of the above distribution is at least 33, which of the following must be true?\nI. 0 ≤ h ≤ 3\nII. 3 ≤ k ≤ 9\nIII. 3 ≤ k - h ≤ 5\n\n- A. I only\n- B. II only\n- C. I and III only\n- D. II and III only",
