   "text": "An economist said, 'The continuous fall in stock prices in our country has already affected the consumption expenditure as well as the money demand. We should implement a policy to relieve the effects on the output level and the interest rate.' Which of the following policies can stabilise the output level and the interest rate in the country at the same time in the short run?\n(Assume the interest rate is mainly affected by the asset demand for money in this case.)\n\n- A. The government increases cash subsidy to the poor.\n- B. The government gives tariff exemption to the imports of goods.\n- C. The central bank instructs the commercial banks to tighten the requirement of personal loans.\n- D. The central bank buys government bonds from the public.",
   "html": "<p>37.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;An economist said, 'The continuous fall in stock prices in our country has already affected the consumption expenditure as well as the money demand. We should implement a policy to relieve the effects on the output level and the interest rate.' Which of the following policies can stabilise the output level and the interest rate in the country at the same time in the short run?\n(Assume the interest rate is mainly affected by the asset demand for money in this case.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A. The government increases cash subsidy to the poor.</li>\n<li>B. The government gives tariff exemption to the imports of goods.</li>\n<li>C. The central bank instructs the commercial banks to tighten the requirement of personal loans.</li>\n<li>D. The central bank buys government bonds from the public.</li>\n</ul>",
